Subject: [PATCH 3/7] staging/ozwpan: Fix sparse warning Using plain integer as NULL pointer
Date: Fri, 15 Feb 2013 06:25:31 +0100
Message-Id: <1360905935-20601-3-git-send-email-peterhuewe@gmx.de>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.8.6
In-Reply-To: <1360905935-20601-1-git-send-email-peterhuewe@gmx.de>
References: <1360905935-20601-1-git-send-email-peterhuewe@gmx.de>
